<title>UK: Sullom Voe oil liftings soar in week to Feb 25.</title>
<headline>Sullom Voe oil liftings soar in week to Feb 25.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brent Blend crude loadings from Britan's Sullom Voe terminal jumped sharply to 970,524 tonnes in the week to February 25 from 270,105 tonnes the previous week, Shetland Islands Marine Operations said.</p>
<p>Most oil sailed to the United States and Canada with the balance moving to the UK and Rotterdam.</p>
